  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Scheme to Promote Mechanization for the Development of Horticulture&amp;quot; launched by the Horticulture and Food Processing Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh, aims to encourage mechanization in horticulture through providing subsidies on various modern machines to eligible farmers.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant must be a farmer.\n  - The applicant must be a resident of Madhya Pradesh.\n\n<br>\n\n",
